{"title":"Market stall weather review","genre":"software","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nBuild an offline sales review tool for a weekend flower stall. Include this fictional 2026 history in the format date, weather, hours open, bouquets brought, bouquets sold, revenue in whole dollars: May 2, dry, 4, 36, 31, 310; May 3, rain, 3, 30, 14, 140; May 9, dry, 5, 45, 42, 420; May 10, rain, 4, 32, 19, 190; May 16, dry, 4, 40, 35, 350; May 17, rain, 2, 25, 9, 90. Allow new entries and corrections. Compare sell-through and revenue per open hour by weather using pooled totals, and display the underlying counts alongside each rate.","works":{"89e2be26f6bd8526":{"files":[{"name":"index.html","bytes":13066,"sha256":"ecfd2e011ea7fa83671dc65af5fab62d2e200ad417f50de42ea1dc6bc6ef3bd4","kind":"text","body":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Stem Ledger · Sales review</title>\n<style>\n:root{color-scheme:light;--ink:#233d32;--muted:#56675e;--line:#d6dbd1;--paper:#faf9f4;--serif:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.45 'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif}header{background:#213e32;color:#fffdf2}.wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding:0 5%}header .wrap,.row,.title,.cardhead,.ledgerhead{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}header .wrap{min-height:65px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font:24px var(--serif)}.brand svg{width:34px;height:34px;color:#e5dfac}.offline{font-size:13px}.offline::before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#b9cf9a;border-radius:50%;margin-right:9px}main{padding-bottom:48px!important}.title{padding:34px 0 25px}.over,.stat small,th,.metric label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase}.over{color:var(--muted)}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}h1,h2,h3,.number,.stat b{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400}h1{font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,62px);line-height:1.13;letter-spacing:-.055em}h2{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.04em}h3{font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.035em}button,select,input{font:inherit;color:inherit}button{cursor:pointer;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:10px 16px;min-height:44px}button:hover{background:#e8ede4}.primary{background:#284a39;color:white;border-color:#284a39}.primary:hover{background:#173726}.primary span{margin-right:8px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-block:1px solid #aab6a9;padding:18px 0}.stat{padding-left:24px;border-left:1px solid var(--line)}.stat:first-child{padding-left:0;border:0}.stat small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.stat b{font-size:33px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.04em}.sectionhead{margin:26px 0 13px}.hint,.counts,.daycount{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.card{border:1px solid #daca9e;border-radius:10px;background:#f6efd9;padding:17px 21px 19px}.card.rain{background:#e6efec;border-color:#c5d4cd}.cardhead{border-bottom:1px solid #cfc7ac;padding-bottom:12px}.rain .cardhead{border-color:#c2d0ca}.weathername{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.icon{width:28px;height:28px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.dry .icon{color:#8b641e}.rain .icon{color:#426d64}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:15px}.metric label{display:block;font-size:10px}.number{font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px);letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1.3}.counts{font-size:12px}.ledgerhead{margin:25px 0 10px}.ledgerhead select{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:8px;min-height:40px}.tablewrap{overflow-x:auto}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}td,th{text-align:right;padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}th{text-transform:uppercase;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);padding-block:10px;background:#edf0e8}td:first-child,th:first-child,td:nth-child(2),th:nth-child(2){text-align:left}td:first-child{font-weight:600}.chip{font-size:12px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 8px;background:#efe5c7}.chip.rain{background:#deebe5}.chip svg{width:15px;height:15px}.edit{padding:0 8px;border:0;font-size:13px;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%)}dialog{width:min(460px,94vw);padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}dialog::backdrop{background:#12251aba}form .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:18px 0}form label{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}input,form select{display:block;width:100%;min-width:0;border:1px solid #9da99f;border-radius:4px;background:white;padding:10px;margin-top:5px}.actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px}.error{color:#8e2823;margin:8px 0}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #84701d;outline-offset:2px}\n@media(max-width:720px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;row-gap:16px}.stat:nth-child(3){padding-left:0;border:0}.title{padding:24px 0 20px}.number{font-size:36px}.stat b{font-size:28px}.wrap{padding-inline:18px}.primary{padding-inline:12px}.stat small{font-size:10px}td,th{padding-inline:7px}}\n</style></head><body>\n<svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\" style=\"position:absolute\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs>\n<symbol id=\"flower\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M20 37V20M20 32Q8 31 6 22Q17 21 20 32ZM20 28Q22 19 34 20Q31 28 20 28Z\"/><path d=\"M17 10C9 0 22 -3 22 7C29 -1 36 9 26 12C37 16 29 25 23 17C23 29 11 24 16 16C4 20 5 7 17 10Z\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></g></symbol>\n<symbol id=\"dry\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 1v3m0 16v3M1 12h3m16 0h3M4 4l2 2m12 12 2 2M4 20l2-2M18 6l2-2\"/></symbol><symbol id=\"rain\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 15a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-1-9 6.5 6.5 0 0 1 12.4.1A4.5 4.5 0 1 1 18 15ZM7 18l-1.5 3m6.5-3-1.5 3m6.5-3-1.5 3\"/></symbol></defs></svg>\n<header><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"brand\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#flower\"/></svg>Stem Ledger</div><span class=\"offline\">Offline workspace</span></div></header>\n<main class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"title\"><div><div class=\"over\">Weekend flower stall</div><h1>Sales review</h1></div><button class=\"primary\" id=\"add\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span>New entry</button></div>\n<p id=\"warning\" class=\"error\" role=\"alert\"></p><div id=\"stats\" class=\"stats\"></div>\n<section><div class=\"sectionhead\"><h2>Weather comparison</h2><p class=\"hint\">Rates use pooled totals across all stall days for each weather type.</p></div><div class=\"cards\" id=\"cards\"></div></section>\n<section><div class=\"ledgerhead\"><h2>Stall journal</h2><select aria-label=\"Filter journal by weather\" id=\"filter\"><option value=\"\">All weather</option><option value=\"dry\">Dry</option><option value=\"rain\">Rain</option></select></div><div class=\"tablewrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Stall journal entries\"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Weather</th><th>Hours open</th><th>Brought</th><th>Sold</th><th>Revenue</th><th><span class=\"sr\">Actions</span></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"journal\"></tbody></table></div></section><p class=\"sr\" id=\"status\" role=\"status\"></p></main>\n<dialog id=\"editor\" aria-labelledby=\"formTitle\"><form id=\"form\"><h2 id=\"formTitle\">New entry</h2><div class=\"grid\"><label>Date<input type=\"date\" name=\"date\" required min=\"0001-01-01\" max=\"9999-12-31\"></label><label>Weather<select name=\"weather\"><option value=\"dry\">Dry</option><option value=\"rain\">Rain</option></select></label><label>Hours open<input name=\"hours\" type=\"number\" required step=\"any\" min=\"0\" max=\"24\"></label><label>Revenue ($)<input name=\"revenue\" type=\"number\" required min=\"0\" step=\"1\"></label><label>Bouquets brought<input name=\"brought\" type=\"number\" required min=\"0\" step=\"1\"></label><label>Bouquets sold<input name=\"sold\" type=\"number\" required min=\"0\" step=\"1\"></label></div><p id=\"error\" role=\"alert\" class=\"error\"></p><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"cancel\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button><button class=\"primary\">Save entry</button></div></form></dialog>\n<script>\n'use strict';\nconst $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\nconst key = 'stem-ledger-v1';\nconst seed = [\n ['02','dry',4,36,31,310],['03','rain',3,30,14,140],['09','dry',5,45,42,420],\n ['10','rain',4,32,19,190],['16','dry',4,40,35,350],['17','rain',2,25,9,90]\n].map(([day,weather,hours,brought,sold,revenue])=>({date:'2026-05-'+day,weather,hours,brought,sold,revenue}));\nconst money = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:'USD',maximumFractionDigits:0});\nconst hourMoney = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:'USD'});\nconst dateFormat = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US',{month:'short',day:'numeric',year:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'});\nconst cap = s=>s[0].toUpperCase()+s.slice(1);\nconst icon = w=>'<svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#'+w+'\"/></svg>';\nfunction valid(r){\n if(!r || !/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(r.date)) return false;\n const day=new Date(r.date+'T00:00:00Z');\n return Number.isFinite(+day) && day.toISOString().slice(0,10)===r.date &&\n ['dry','rain'].includes(r.weather) && Number.isFinite(r.hours) && r.hours>0 && r.hours<=24 &&\n [r.brought,r.sold,r.revenue].every(n=>Number.isSafeInteger(n)&&n>=0) && r.sold<=r.brought;\n}\nfunction readDays(){\n const saved=localStorage.getItem(key);\n if(saved===null) return seed;\n const list=JSON.parse(saved);\n if(!Array.isArray(list)||!list.every(valid)||new Set(list.map(r=>r.date)).size!==list.length) throw Error();\n return list;\n}\nlet days=[], editing=null;\nfunction reload(){\n try{days=readDays();$('warning').textContent='';$('add').disabled=false}\n catch{$('warning').textContent='Saved entries could not be loaded. Check browser storage access and reopen this file.';$('add').disabled=true}\n render();\n}\nfunction totals(rows){\n return rows.reduce((t,r)=>{for(const k of Object.keys(t)) t[k]+=r[k];return t},{hours:0,brought:0,sold:0,revenue:0});\n}\nfunction render(){\n const all=totals(days);\n $('stats').innerHTML=[['Stall days',days.length],['Hours open',+all.hours.toFixed(8)],['Bouquets sold',all.sold],['Total revenue',money.format(all.revenue)]].map(([label,n])=>'<div class=\"stat\"><small>'+label+'</small><b>'+n+'</b></div>').join('');\n $('cards').innerHTML=['dry','rain'].map(w=>{\n const rows=days.filter(r=>r.weather===w),t=totals(rows);\n const metric=(label,value,basis)=>'<div class=\"metric\"><label>'+label+'</label><div class=\"number\">'+value+'</div><div class=\"counts\">'+basis+'</div></div>';\n return '<article class=\"card '+w+'\"><div class=\"cardhead\"><h3 class=\"weathername\">'+icon(w)+cap(w)+'</h3><span class=\"daycount\">'+rows.length+' stall '+(rows.length===1?'day':'days')+'</span></div><div class=\"metrics\">'+\n metric('Sell-through',t.brought?(100*t.sold/t.brought).toFixed(1)+'%':'—',t.sold+' sold / '+t.brought+' brought')+\n metric('Revenue per hour',t.hours?hourMoney.format(t.revenue/t.hours):'—',money.format(t.revenue)+' / '+Number(t.hours.toFixed(8))+' open hours')+'</div></article>';\n }).join('');\n const visible=days.filter(r=>!$('filter').value||r.weather===$('filter').value).sort((a,b)=>b.date.localeCompare(a.date));\n $('journal').innerHTML=visible.map(r=>{\n const date=dateFormat.format(new Date(r.date+'T00:00:00Z'));\n return '<tr><td>'+date+'</td><td><span class=\"chip '+r.weather+'\">'+icon(r.weather)+cap(r.weather)+'</span></td><td>'+r.hours+'</td><td>'+r.brought+'</td><td>'+r.sold+'</td><td>'+money.format(r.revenue)+'</td><td><button class=\"edit\" data-date=\"'+r.date+'\" aria-label=\"Edit '+date+'\">Edit</button></td></tr>';\n }).join('')||'<tr><td colspan=\"7\">No entries for this weather.</td></tr>';\n}\nfunction openForm(row){\n editing=row||null;\n $('form').reset();$('error').textContent='';\n $('formTitle').textContent=row?'Edit entry':'New entry';\n if(row) for(const [name,value] of Object.entries(row)) $('form').elements[name].value=value;\n $('editor').showModal();\n}\n$('add').onclick=()=>openForm();\n$('journal').onclick=e=>{const btn=e.target.closest('[data-date]');if(btn) openForm(days.find(r=>r.date===btn.dataset.date))};\n$('cancel').onclick=()=>$('editor').close();\n$('filter').onchange=render;\n$('form').onsubmit=e=>{\n e.preventDefault();\n const r=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target));\n for(const k of ['hours','brought','sold','revenue']) r[k]=Number(r[k]);\n const fail=msg=>{$('error').textContent=msg};\n if(r.hours<=0) return fail('Enter more than zero hours open.');\n if(r.sold>r.brought) return fail('Bouquets sold cannot exceed bouquets brought.');\n if(!valid(r)) return fail('Check the date, hours, whole bouquet counts and whole-dollar revenue.');\n try{\n const latest=readDays();\n if(editing && JSON.stringify(latest.find(x=>x.date===editing.date))!==JSON.stringify(editing)) return fail('This entry changed in another window. Cancel and reopen it.');\n if(latest.some(x=>x.date===r.date && x.date!==editing?.date)) return fail('An entry already exists for this date. Edit that journal entry to correct it.');\n const updated=latest.filter(x=>x.date!==editing?.date).concat(r);\n localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(updated));days=updated;\n }catch{return fail('Could not save. Check browser storage access and try again.')}\n if($('filter').value!==r.weather) $('filter').value='';\n $('editor').close();render();$('status').textContent='Entry saved for '+r.date;\n const savedButton=document.querySelector('[data-date=\"'+r.date+'\"]');savedButton?.focus();\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('storage',e=>{if(e.key===key||e.key===null) reload()});\nreload();\n</script></body></html>\n"}],"download":"data/release/assets/c42edab3bfb5724e61432d5e0be4c6a3919d75a7a68808a3ea10f6b80ad36e1f.zip"},"09ab0e4c343d6764":{"files":[{"name":"index.html","bytes":27707,"sha256":"48e652cb1039ace9009ba85922923edde28bb3bb2c361d8b46a3cd9ae7e71637","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Flower Stall · Weekend Sales Review</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    color-scheme: light;\n    --paper: #f6f5ef;\n    --surface: #fffefa;\n    --ink: #1e3028;\n    --muted: #536359;\n    --line: #e0e4d9;\n    --pine: #204637;\n    --pine-dark: #16392c;\n    --dry: #b6752e;\n    --dry-bg: #f7ead4;\n    --rain: #4b7981;\n    --rain-bg: #e4eff0;\n    --radius: 16px;\n    font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif;\n  }\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); }\n  h1, h2, p { margin: 0; }\n  h1, h2 { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.08; }\n  h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.13rem); letter-spacing: -.035em; }\n  h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.06rem; line-height: 1.35; }\n  button, input, select { font: inherit; }\n  button { cursor: pointer; touch-action: manipulation; }\n  :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #8d570f; outline-offset: 3px; }\n  .shell { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 64px)); margin-inline: auto; }\n  .top { background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .top .shell, .brand, .top-actions, .section-head, .hero-date, .weather, .chart-head {\n    display: flex; align-items: center;\n  }\n  .top .shell { justify-content: space-between; min-height: 76px; gap: 12px; }\n  .brand { gap: 11px; font: 1.23rem Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.025em; }\n  .mark { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 37px; height: 37px; border-radius: 11px; background: var(--pine); }\n  .top-actions { gap: 21px; }\n  .local { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }\n  .local::before { content: \"\"; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #568361; }\n  .button {\n    min-height: 44px; padding: 0 16px; display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 9px; font-weight: 650; font-size: .87rem;\n  }\n  .primary { background: var(--pine); color: white; }\n  .primary:hover { background: var(--pine-dark); }\n  .secondary { background: var(--surface); border-color: #bdc9bd; color: var(--pine); }\n  .secondary:hover, .edit:hover { background: #ecf1e9; }\n  .plus { font-size: 1.23rem; line-height: 1; font-weight: 400; }\n  main { padding-block: 32px 36px; }\n  .hero {\n    display: grid; position: relative; isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden;\n    align-items: center; min-height: 232px; padding: 30px 38px; border-radius: var(--radius);\n    color: #fffdf1; background: var(--pine-dark);\n    background-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 0%, #2e5642, transparent 64%);\n  }\n  .hero canvas { position: absolute; z-index: -1; right: 0; top: 0; width: 465px; height: 100%; }\n  .hero-copy { width: fit-content; }\n  .hero-date { gap: 9px; color: #e4d5a9; font-weight: 650; font-size: .74rem; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .hero-date::before { content: \"\"; width: 17px; height: 1px; background: currentColor; }\n  h1 { margin-top: 12px; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.6vw, 4.1rem); letter-spacing: -.055em; text-wrap: balance; }\n  .hero p { color: #dce8dc; margin-top: 13px; font-size: .98rem; }\n  section { margin-top: 32px; }\n  .section-head { justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 15px; }\n  .section-head p, footer { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted); }\n  .comparison { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }\n  .chart, .ledger { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--surface); }\n  .chart { padding: 18px 21px 19px; min-width: 0; }\n  .chart-head { justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 5px 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .chart-head p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; }\n  .chart-rows { display: grid; gap: 13px; margin-top: 15px; }\n  .chart-row { display: grid; gap: 5px; }\n  .chart-values { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }\n  .weather { display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; width: fit-content; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 650; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .weather.dry { color: #654312; background: var(--dry-bg); }\n  .weather.rain { color: #2c555e; background: var(--rain-bg); }\n  .weather canvas { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n  .metric { font: 1.58rem/1 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.035em; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n  .track { height: 7px; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; background: #eceee7; }\n  .bar { width: 0; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; }\n  .bar.dry { background: var(--dry); }\n  .bar.rain { background: var(--rain); }\n  .basis { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; }\n  .metric, .basis, .number { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .ledger { overflow: hidden; }\n  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }\n  th, td { padding: 5px 16px; text-align: left; }\n  thead th {\n    padding-block: 12px; background: #eef1e8; color: #44554b; font-size: .72rem;\n    font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .045em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  tbody th, tbody td { font-size: .9rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  tbody th { font-weight: 630; }\n  tbody tr:hover { background: #f9faf4; }\n  .number { text-align: right; }\n  .action { text-align: right; }\n  .edit { min-width: 53px; min-height: 44px; padding: 4px 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 8px; color: var(--pine); background: transparent; font-weight: 650; font-size: .81rem; }\n  .mobile-label { display: none; }\n  footer { padding-top: 18px; }\n  .status { margin-top: 13px; font-size: .88rem; color: var(--pine); }\n  .status:empty { margin: 0; }\n  .error { color: #8a3027; }\n  dialog {\n    width: min(500px, calc(100% - 32px)); max-height: calc(100% - 32px); padding: 24px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  dialog::backdrop { background: #14291fb0; }\n  .form-fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-block: 19px; }\n  label { display: grid; gap: 5px; font-size: .87rem; font-weight: 650; }\n  input, select { width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 44px; padding: 7px 9px; border: 1px solid #aab7ab; border-radius: 7px; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1rem; }\n  .form-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: flex-end; }\n  .form-error { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: .87rem; }\n  .form-error:empty { margin: 0; }\n  .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; }\n  @media (max-width: 950px) {\n    .hero canvas { right: -64px; opacity: .65; }\n    .hero-copy { background: #16392ce0; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 0 32px 14px #16392ce0; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 680px) {\n    .shell { width: calc(100% - 32px); }\n    .top .shell { min-height: 66px; }\n    .local { display: none; }\n    main { padding-top: 20px; }\n    .hero { min-height: 194px; padding: 23px; }\n    .hero canvas { right: -224px; opacity: .48; }\n    .hero p { font-size: .88rem; }\n    section { margin-top: 26px; }\n    .comparison { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }\n    .chart { padding: 17px; }\n    thead { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); }\n    table, tbody { display: block; }\n    tbody tr { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); padding: 12px 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); gap: 7px 12px; }\n    tbody tr:first-child { border-top: 0; }\n    tbody th, tbody td { border: 0; padding: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n    tbody .number { text-align: left; }\n    tbody td:nth-child(2) { text-align: right; }\n    .mobile-label { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; }\n    .action { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 340px) {\n    .brand { font-size: 1rem; gap: 7px; }\n    .button { padding-inline: 11px; }\n    .form-fields { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"shell\">\n    <div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"mark\"><canvas id=\"brand-mark\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" style=\"width:26px;height:26px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas></span>Flower Stall</div>\n    <div class=\"top-actions\">\n      <span class=\"local\">Offline ledger</span>\n      <button class=\"button primary\" id=\"add\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span> Add entry</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main class=\"shell\">\n  <div class=\"hero\">\n    <canvas id=\"botanical\" width=\"930\" height=\"464\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n    <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n      <div id=\"date-range\" class=\"hero-date\"></div>\n      <h1>Weekend sales review</h1>\n      <p>See how weather relates to bouquet sales at the stall.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"status\" id=\"status\" role=\"status\"></p>\n  <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript in your browser to open the sales ledger.</p></noscript>\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"comparison-heading\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <h2 id=\"comparison-heading\">Sales by weather</h2>\n      <p>Each rate uses pooled totals for that weather.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"comparison\">\n      <article class=\"chart\" aria-labelledby=\"sell-title\">\n        <div class=\"chart-head\"><h3 id=\"sell-title\">Sell-through</h3><p>Bouquets sold ÷ brought</p></div>\n        <div class=\"chart-rows\" id=\"sell-chart\"></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"chart\" aria-labelledby=\"revenue-title\">\n        <div class=\"chart-head\"><h3 id=\"revenue-title\">Revenue per open hour</h3><p>Revenue ÷ hours open</p></div>\n        <div class=\"chart-rows\" id=\"revenue-chart\"></div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"log-heading\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <h2 id=\"log-heading\">Sales log</h2>\n      <p id=\"entry-count\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ledger\">\n      <table role=\"table\" aria-labelledby=\"log-heading\">\n        <thead role=\"rowgroup\"><tr role=\"row\">\n          <th scope=\"col\" role=\"columnheader\">Date</th><th scope=\"col\" role=\"columnheader\">Weather</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" role=\"columnheader\" class=\"number\">Hours open</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" role=\"columnheader\" class=\"number\">Bouquets brought</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" role=\"columnheader\" class=\"number\">Bouquets sold</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" role=\"columnheader\" class=\"number\">Revenue</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" role=\"columnheader\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Actions</span></th>\n        </tr></thead>\n        <tbody role=\"rowgroup\" id=\"entries\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <footer>Entries are saved in this browser. Reopen this file in the same browser to keep working.</footer>\n</main>\n<dialog id=\"editor\" aria-labelledby=\"editor-title\">\n  <form id=\"entry-form\">\n    <h2 id=\"editor-title\">Add entry</h2>\n    <div class=\"form-fields\">\n      <label>Date<input name=\"date\" type=\"date\" required autofocus></label>\n      <label>Weather<select name=\"weather\" required><option value=\"\">Choose weather</option><option value=\"dry\">Dry</option><option value=\"rain\">Rain</option></select></label>\n      <label>Hours open<input name=\"hours\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" required inputmode=\"decimal\"></label>\n      <label>Revenue (whole dollars)<input name=\"revenue\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"9007199254740991\" step=\"1\" required inputmode=\"numeric\"></label>\n      <label>Bouquets brought<input name=\"brought\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"9007199254740991\" step=\"1\" required inputmode=\"numeric\"></label>\n      <label>Bouquets sold<input name=\"sold\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"9007199254740991\" step=\"1\" required inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-describedby=\"form-error\"></label>\n    </div>\n    <p id=\"form-error\" class=\"form-error error\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n    <div class=\"form-actions\">\n      <button class=\"button secondary\" id=\"cancel\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button>\n      <button class=\"button primary\" type=\"submit\">Save entry</button>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n</dialog>\n<template id=\"weather-template\"><span class=\"weather\"><canvas width=\"28\" height=\"28\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas><span></span></span></template>\n<script>\n  'use strict';\n\n  const seed = [\n    ['2026-05-02', 'dry', 4, 36, 31, 310],\n    ['2026-05-03', 'rain', 3, 30, 14, 140],\n    ['2026-05-09', 'dry', 5, 45, 42, 420],\n    ['2026-05-10', 'rain', 4, 32, 19, 190],\n    ['2026-05-16', 'dry', 4, 40, 35, 350],\n    ['2026-05-17', 'rain', 2, 25, 9, 90],\n  ].map(([date, weather, hours, brought, sold, revenue], id) => ({ id: 'seed-' + id, date, weather, hours, brought, sold, revenue }));\n\n  const storageKey = 'flower-stall-ledger-v1';\n  const labels = { dry: 'Dry', rain: 'Rain' };\n  const weatherTypes = Object.keys(labels);\n  const count = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US');\n  const hoursFormat = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { maximumSignificantDigits: 15 });\n  const dollars = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD', maximumFractionDigits: 0 });\n  const hourly = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD' });\n  const percent = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'percent', maximumFractionDigits: 1, minimumFractionDigits: 1 });\n  const fullDate = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric', timeZone: 'UTC' });\n  const monthDay = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', timeZone: 'UTC' });\n  const dayOnly = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', { day: 'numeric', timeZone: 'UTC' });\n  const byId = id => document.getElementById(id);\n  const editor = byId('editor');\n  const form = byId('entry-form');\n  const fields = form.elements;\n  const formError = byId('form-error');\n  let entries = seed;\n  let editing = null;\n  let returnFocus = null;\n\n  function report(message, error = false) {\n    const status = byId('status');\n    status.textContent = message;\n    status.classList.toggle('error', error);\n  }\n\n  function readEntries() {\n    const raw = localStorage.getItem(storageKey);\n    if (raw === null) return seed;\n    const list = JSON.parse(raw);\n    if (!Array.isArray(list) || list.some(entry => !entry || typeof entry.id !== 'string' || validationError(entry)) ||\n        new Set(list.map(entry => entry.id)).size !== list.length) {\n      throw new Error('Invalid ledger');\n    }\n    return list;\n  }\n\n  function validationError(entry) {\n    const date = new Date(entry.date + 'T00:00:00Z');\n    if (!/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(entry.date) || !Number.isFinite(+date) ||\n        date.toISOString().slice(0, 10) !== entry.date || entry.date.startsWith('0000')) {\n      return 'Enter a valid date between years 1 and 9999.';\n    }\n    if (!weatherTypes.includes(entry.weather)) return 'Choose dry or rain.';\n    if (!Number.isFinite(entry.hours) || entry.hours < 0) return 'Enter zero or more hours open.';\n    if (!['brought', 'sold', 'revenue'].every(key => Number.isSafeInteger(entry[key]) && entry[key] >= 0)) {\n      return 'Use nonnegative whole numbers for bouquet counts and revenue.';\n    }\n    if (entry.sold > entry.brought) return 'Bouquets sold cannot exceed bouquets brought.';\n    return '';\n  }\n\n  function summarize(list) {\n    const totals = Object.fromEntries(weatherTypes.map(weather => [weather, { sessions: 0, hours: 0, brought: 0, sold: 0, revenue: 0 }]));\n    for (const entry of list) {\n      const total = totals[entry.weather];\n      total.sessions++;\n      for (const key of ['hours', 'brought', 'sold', 'revenue']) total[key] += entry[key];\n    }\n    for (const total of Object.values(totals)) {\n      total.sellThrough = total.brought ? total.sold / total.brought : null;\n      total.perHour = total.hours ? total.revenue / total.hours : null;\n    }\n    return totals;\n  }\n\n  function dateRange(sorted) {\n    if (!sorted.length) return 'No recorded dates';\n    const first = new Date(sorted.at(-1).date + 'T00:00:00Z');\n    const last = new Date(sorted[0].date + 'T00:00:00Z');\n    if (+first === +last) return fullDate.format(last);\n    if (first.getUTCFullYear() !== last.getUTCFullYear()) return fullDate.format(first) + ' – ' + fullDate.format(last);\n    if (first.getUTCMonth() === last.getUTCMonth()) return monthDay.format(first) + '–' + dayOnly.format(last) + ', ' + last.getUTCFullYear();\n    return monthDay.format(first) + ' – ' + fullDate.format(last);\n  }\n\n  function element(tag, className, value) {\n    const node = document.createElement(tag);\n    if (className) node.className = className;\n    if (value !== undefined) node.textContent = value;\n    return node;\n  }\n\n  function weatherBadge(weather) {\n    const badge = byId('weather-template').content.firstElementChild.cloneNode(true);\n    badge.classList.add(weather);\n    badge.querySelector('span').textContent = labels[weather];\n    const ctx = badge.querySelector('canvas').getContext('2d');\n    ctx.scale(2, 2);\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1.1;\n    ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n    ctx.strokeStyle = weather === 'dry' ? '#835417' : '#38616b';\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    if (weather === 'dry') {\n      ctx.arc(7, 7, 2.6, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      for (let ray = 0; ray < 8; ray++) {\n        const angle = ray * Math.PI / 4;\n        ctx.moveTo(7 + Math.cos(angle) * 4.3, 7 + Math.sin(angle) * 4.3);\n        ctx.lineTo(7 + Math.cos(angle) * 5.6, 7 + Math.sin(angle) * 5.6);\n      }\n    } else {\n      ctx.moveTo(3, 8.5);\n      ctx.bezierCurveTo(0, 8.5, 1.2, 3.9, 4.2, 4.6);\n      ctx.bezierCurveTo(5, 1.1, 9.7, 1.5, 10.3, 4.9);\n      ctx.bezierCurveTo(13.9, 4.3, 14, 8.5, 11.6, 8.5);\n      ctx.lineTo(3, 8.5);\n      for (const x of [5, 9]) {\n        ctx.moveTo(x, 10.3);\n        ctx.lineTo(x - 1, 12.2);\n      }\n    }\n    ctx.stroke();\n    return badge;\n  }\n\n  function renderChart(target, totals, metric, format, basis, scale) {\n    target.replaceChildren(...weatherTypes.map(weather => {\n      const total = totals[weather];\n      const value = total[metric];\n      const row = element('div', 'chart-row');\n      const values = element('div', 'chart-values');\n      const rate = element('strong', 'metric', value === null ? '—' : format.format(value));\n      if (value === null) rate.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Rate unavailable');\n      values.append(weatherBadge(weather), rate);\n      const track = element('div', 'track');\n      track.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');\n      const bar = element('div', 'bar ' + weather);\n      bar.style.width = (value === null ? 0 : value / scale * 100) + '%';\n      track.append(bar);\n      const sessions = count.format(total.sessions) + (total.sessions === 1 ? ' session' : ' sessions');\n      row.append(values, track, element('p', 'basis', basis(total) + ' · ' + sessions));\n      return row;\n    }));\n  }\n\n  function numberCell(label, value) {\n    const cell = element('td', 'number');\n    cell.setAttribute('role', 'cell');\n    const mobileLabel = element('span', 'mobile-label', label);\n    mobileLabel.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');\n    cell.append(mobileLabel, document.createTextNode(value));\n    return cell;\n  }\n\n  function render() {\n    const totals = summarize(entries);\n    renderChart(byId('sell-chart'), totals, 'sellThrough', percent,\n      t => count.format(t.sold) + ' sold / ' + count.format(t.brought) + ' brought', 1);\n    const maxHourly = Math.max(1, ...weatherTypes.map(weather => totals[weather].perHour ?? 0));\n    renderChart(byId('revenue-chart'), totals, 'perHour', hourly,\n      t => dollars.format(t.revenue) + ' revenue / ' + hoursFormat.format(t.hours) + ' ' + (t.hours === 1 ? 'hour' : 'hours'), maxHourly);\n    const sorted = [...entries].sort((a, b) => b.date.localeCompare(a.date));\n    byId('date-range').textContent = dateRange(sorted);\n    byId('entry-count').textContent = count.format(entries.length) + (entries.length === 1 ? ' recorded session' : ' recorded sessions');\n    byId('entries').replaceChildren(...sorted.map(entry => {\n      const row = element('tr');\n      row.setAttribute('role', 'row');\n      const dateLabel = fullDate.format(new Date(entry.date + 'T00:00:00Z'));\n      const date = element('th', '', dateLabel);\n      date.scope = 'row';\n      date.setAttribute('role', 'rowheader');\n      const weather = element('td');\n      weather.setAttribute('role', 'cell');\n      weather.append(weatherBadge(entry.weather));\n      const action = element('td', 'action');\n      action.setAttribute('role', 'cell');\n      const edit = element('button', 'edit', 'Edit');\n      edit.type = 'button';\n      edit.dataset.id = entry.id;\n      edit.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Edit entry for ' + dateLabel + ', ' + labels[entry.weather]);\n      edit.addEventListener('click', () => openEditor(entry, edit));\n      action.append(edit);\n      row.append(date, weather, numberCell('Hours open', hoursFormat.format(entry.hours)),\n        numberCell('Bouquets brought', count.format(entry.brought)), numberCell('Bouquets sold', count.format(entry.sold)),\n        numberCell('Revenue', dollars.format(entry.revenue)), action);\n      return row;\n    }));\n  }\n\n  function openEditor(entry, trigger) {\n    editing = entry;\n    returnFocus = trigger;\n    form.reset();\n    formError.textContent = '';\n    byId('editor-title').textContent = entry ? 'Edit entry' : 'Add entry';\n    if (entry) {\n      for (const key of ['date', 'weather', 'hours', 'brought', 'sold', 'revenue']) fields[key].value = entry[key];\n    }\n    editor.showModal();\n  }\n\n  byId('add').addEventListener('click', event => openEditor(null, event.currentTarget));\n  byId('cancel').addEventListener('click', () => editor.close());\n  editor.addEventListener('close', () => (returnFocus?.isConnected ? returnFocus : byId('add')).focus());\n  form.addEventListener('input', () => { formError.textContent = ''; });\n\n  form.addEventListener('submit', event => {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    const entry = {\n      id: editing?.id ?? crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint32Array(4)).join('-'),\n      date: fields.date.value,\n      weather: fields.weather.value,\n      hours: fields.hours.valueAsNumber,\n      brought: fields.brought.valueAsNumber,\n      sold: fields.sold.valueAsNumber,\n      revenue: fields.revenue.valueAsNumber,\n    };\n    const error = validationError(entry);\n    if (error) {\n      formError.textContent = error;\n      if (entry.sold > entry.brought) fields.sold.focus();\n      return;\n    }\n    try {\n      const latest = readEntries();\n      if (editing && JSON.stringify(latest.find(item => item.id === editing.id)) !== JSON.stringify(editing)) {\n        formError.textContent = 'This entry changed in another tab. Cancel and open the updated entry before correcting it.';\n        return;\n      }\n      const updated = editing ? latest.map(item => item.id === editing.id ? entry : item) : [...latest, entry];\n      const totals = summarize(updated);\n      if (Object.values(totals).some(total => !Number.isFinite(total.hours) ||\n          (total.perHour !== null && !Number.isFinite(total.perHour)) ||\n          !['brought', 'sold', 'revenue'].every(key => Number.isSafeInteger(total[key])))) {\n        formError.textContent = 'The pooled values are too large. Check the numbers and try again.';\n        return;\n      }\n      localStorage.setItem(storageKey, JSON.stringify(updated));\n      entries = updated;\n    } catch {\n      formError.textContent = 'The browser could not save this entry. Check that local storage is available, then try again.';\n      return;\n    }\n    render();\n    if (editing) {\n      returnFocus = [...byId('entries').querySelectorAll('button')].find(button => button.dataset.id === entry.id);\n    }\n    editor.close();\n    report(editing ? 'Entry corrected.' : 'Entry added.');\n  });\n\n  function refresh() {\n    try {\n      entries = readEntries();\n      report('');\n    } catch {\n      report('The saved ledger could not be read. The page is showing the last available entries.', true);\n    }\n    render();\n  }\n\n  window.addEventListener('storage', event => {\n    if (event.key === storageKey || event.key === null) refresh();\n  });\n\n  function drawBotanical() {\n    const canvas = byId('botanical');\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n    ctx.scale(2, 2);\n    ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n\n    function stem(x, y, bend, base, color) {\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(base, 254);\n      ctx.quadraticCurveTo(bend, y + 69, x, y);\n      ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n      ctx.strokeStyle = color;\n      ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    function leaf(x, y, angle, length, width, color) {\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.translate(x, y);\n      ctx.rotate(angle);\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(0, 0);\n      ctx.quadraticCurveTo(length * .45, -width, length, 0);\n      ctx.quadraticCurveTo(length * .48, width * .87, 0, 0);\n      ctx.fillStyle = color;\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#b4ba835e';\n      ctx.lineWidth = .6;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(1, 0);\n      ctx.quadraticCurveTo(length * .55, -1, length * .85, 0);\n      ctx.stroke();\n      ctx.restore();\n    }\n\n    function flower(context, x, y, radius, petals, color, center, angle) {\n      context.save();\n      context.translate(x, y);\n      context.rotate(angle);\n      const step = 2 * Math.PI / petals;\n      for (let i = 0; i < petals; i++) {\n        const reach = radius * (i % 3 === 0 ? .92 : 1);\n        context.beginPath();\n        context.moveTo(0, 0);\n        context.bezierCurveTo(-radius * .32, -reach * .5, -radius * .26, -reach * .96, 0, -reach);\n        context.bezierCurveTo(radius * .29, -reach * 1.02, radius * .28, -reach * .49, 0, 0);\n        context.fillStyle = color;\n        context.fill();\n        context.strokeStyle = '#16392c70';\n        context.lineWidth = .65;\n        context.stroke();\n        context.rotate(step);\n      }\n      context.beginPath();\n      context.arc(0, 0, radius * .235, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      context.fillStyle = center;\n      context.fill();\n      context.restore();\n    }\n\n    // Fine ruled border and cut-flower stems.\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#e7e0b52b';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n    ctx.strokeRect(70.5, 19.5, 374, 193);\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.ellipse(304, 146, 108, 96, -.35, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n    ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#e7e0b563';\n    for (const [x, y, r] of [[125,54,1.2],[152,77,1],[179,30,1.4],[214,69,1],[236,32,1.5],[341,33,1],[411,58,1.2],[431,102,1.4],[399,160,1],[169,168,1.3],[113,117,1],[418,188,1.4]]) {\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.arc(x, y, r, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      ctx.fill();\n    }\n    stem(175, 115, 234, 282, '#8a9f70');\n    stem(232, 77, 278, 306, '#86a172');\n    stem(301, 50, 320, 293, '#a3ac75');\n    stem(371, 88, 342, 311, '#86a172');\n    stem(405, 128, 353, 302, '#8a9f70');\n    for (const args of [\n      [239,193,-2.8,63,18,'#547d60'], [248,205,-1.43,52,13,'#779069'],\n      [265,151,-2.11,43,10,'#628665'], [275,172,-.97,49,15,'#416b53'],\n      [309,127,-2.44,49,13,'#71936b'], [310,159,-.84,62,16,'#648961'],\n      [333,183,-.29,66,15,'#527f63'], [345,148,-1.37,48,13,'#82a275'],\n      [357,191,-.53,68,13,'#6e8d62'], [368,175,-1.55,35,10,'#64845d'],\n      [281,223,-2.85,51,12,'#64845d'], [307,218,-.94,39,10,'#78956c'],\n    ]) leaf(...args);\n    flower(ctx, 175, 115, 24, 8, '#dca08f', '#efd39b', .28);\n    flower(ctx, 232, 77, 31, 10, '#f0d395', '#916a3b', .15);\n    flower(ctx, 301, 50, 35, 11, '#f6e6c2', '#c49049', .12);\n    flower(ctx, 371, 88, 39, 10, '#d99688', '#f0d28c', .43);\n    flower(ctx, 405, 128, 19, 7, '#edc080', '#926735', .56);\n\n    const mark = byId('brand-mark').getContext('2d');\n    mark.scale(2, 2);\n    flower(mark, 13, 13, 10, 6, '#f5dfaf', '#d39e5e', 0);\n  }\n\n  refresh();\n  drawBotanical();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"download":"data/release/assets/31dd5740f664f473e810ffa848040bedb9effc27343b59d447525e73007326be.zip"}}}
